+   "evidence": [
+    "\"Priced for perfection\" dynamics mean any guidance miss or hyperscaler capex hesitation produces outsized drawdowns.",
+    "\"Why Higher Rates Are Becoming NVIDIA's Biggest Threat\" (24/7 Wall St.) — a rate-hike-driven de-rating risk for AI names; the article is framed around NVDA but the financing-structure logic applies to the whole AI complex, AMD included.",
+    "And the bull's response is essentially \"yes, but look at the forward estimate.\"",
